  <revision rev="2" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>3486430705f0c2bcb027c7da7641e9c8</srcmd5>
    <version>1.1.1</version>
    <time>1793634046</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- Update to 1.1.1:
  * ActionCollection: add a removeAction() API, by name or by
    standard action
  * ShortcutsEditor: add an allowModifierlessShortcuts opt-in to
    record single-key shortcuts
  * Use the KStandardActions::StandardAction enum in QML instead
    of a private copy
  * Fix the HelpContents action text (kde#522072)
  * Return a QKeySequence for a shortcut instead of a localized
    string that cannot be parsed back
  * Fix a memory leak in ActionModel
  * Install the translations under the kirigami-app-components
    translation domain
  * Install KF6KirigamiAppComponentsConfigVersion.cmake
  * Requires KF6 &gt;= 6.29
- Package the translations in a new -lang subpackage</comment>
    <requestid>1394456</requestid>
  </revision>
</revisionlist>
